# source: PolyRuns
# Homopolymer runs arising from poly-A tails, NovaSeq / NextSeq G-
# quadruplex artefacts, or low-complexity library preparation defects.
# Each sequence contributes 60 identical k-mers at k=31, so a single
# k-mer hit to this source is sufficient for confident flagging.
>polyA
AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA
>polyT
TTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTT
